  "start": {
   "title": "Borrowed Foundry",
   "text": "No flowers up here, so the bees are wasps now. The dark is drawn only by the sounds you make: swing the bat. Grab a glowing jar to swap into the body beside a guard wasp; you keep it only while you hold your breath (the jar). Hum it to sleep, but every sleeper costs you energy faster. Get all three asleep at once.",
   "button": "Breathe in"
  },
